{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game nostalgia about the wonderful days of childhood and dreams of space. And, of course, about beloved toys. Each of us dreamed of becoming an astronaut and going on a space adventure during our childhood... Perhaps this game will awaken your dreams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage a group of robots, plan your moves, collect batteries, and avoid traps. This is a game about attentiveness and cleverness in a nostalgic setting of a child's dream of space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key features of the game:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 biomes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique mechanics for simultaneous control of a group of robots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple rules, but genuinely challenging puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All images are hand-drawn </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3589560?t=1769543632","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589560/1745a1de22f9d22504cc5cb3d6755c2917d09e90/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769543632","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589560/0c0ac7c3b71910aa0c74646b1d2cd7fcf15fecf4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769543632","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589560/0c0ac7c3b71910aa0c74646b1d2cd7fcf15fecf4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769543632","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3606130,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game nostalgia about the wonderful days of childhood and dreams of space. And, of course, about beloved toys. Each of us dreamed of becoming an astronaut and going o